msgid "DatadogIntegration|When enabled, pipeline job logs are collected by Datadog and displayed along with pipeline execution traces. This requires CI Visibility to be enabled. Collecting and analyzing logs is free; storing logs long-term is an optional paid feature in Datadog. Learn more %{link_start}here%{link_end}."
